              </div>
              <div class="option-where">design-candidates.css — 2px deep-space, Orbitron, no focus rule of its own (the global ring applies)</div>
              <div class="option-note">
                One rule with a size variant, no untokenized grays, and a real focus state.
                Recommended.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

